<section class="band-mist" id="what" aria-labelledby="what-title">
  <div class="wrap section">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">What it does</p>
        <h2 id="what-title">Dashboards where every figure is traceable</h2>
        <p>FOI at a Glance turns the published statistics into dashboard pages across four areas: requests, decisions, timeliness and reference.</p>
        <p>Filter by agency (any of 235), portfolio, request type (personal or other) and financial year. The charts re-derive from the published facts, and where a selection has no published figure, the page says so.</p>
        <p>Each figure carries a basis label so you can tell what window it covers, and a "Where did this come from?" link to its provenance.</p>
      </div>
