  <h3>How the data is handled</h3>
  <ul class="offerings spaced-bottom">
    <li>Renamed agencies are reported under their current name for all years.</li>
    <li>The 2021 courts merger is reported as new entities, not a rename.</li>
    <li>Trends use published financial years. Quarters are not reconstructed.</li>
    <li>"Requests received" means received from an applicant. Transfers are a separate measure.</li>
    <li>The six-year benchmark uses complete financial years only.</li>
    <li>Agencies below 30 decisions are shown with their rates, not ranked.</li>
  </ul>

